# Pulumi ComponentResource: `AppPlatform`

A single component wrapping S3 + RDS PostgreSQL + IAM service-account role, driven by stack config.

## Layout

```
.
├── Pulumi.yaml
├── Pulumi.dev.yaml
├── Pulumi.prod.yaml
├── index.ts
├── config.ts
└── components/
    └── appPlatform.ts
```

---

## `Pulumi.yaml`

```yaml
name: app-platform
runtime: nodejs
description: S3 + RDS + IAM service account component
```

## `Pulumi.dev.yaml`

```yaml
config:
  aws:region: us-east-1
  app-platform:env: dev
  app-platform:dbInstanceClass: db.t3.micro
  app-platform:dbMultiAz: "false"
  app-platform:dbAllocatedStorage: "20"
  app-platform:backupRetentionDays: "7"
  app-platform:replicaRegion: ""
  app-platform:oidcProviderArn: "arn:aws:iam::111122223333:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/DEVCLUSTERID"
  app-platform:serviceAccount: "default:web-app"
  app-platform:dbPassword:
    secure: v1:AAAAdev-ciphertext-placeholder:onlyEncryptedTextEverLivesInGit
```

## `Pulumi.prod.yaml`

```yaml
config:
  aws:region: us-east-1
  app-platform:env: prod
  app-platform:dbInstanceClass: db.t3.medium
  app-platform:dbMultiAz: "true"
  app-platform:dbAllocatedStorage: "100"
  app-platform:backupRetentionDays: "30"
  app-platform:replicaRegion: us-west-2
  app-platform:oidcProviderArn: "arn:aws:iam::444455556666:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/PRODCLUSTERID"
  app-platform:serviceAccount: "default:web-app"
  app-platform:dbPassword:
    secure: v1:AAAAprod-ciphertext-placeholder:onlyEncryptedTextEverLivesInGit
```

> Set with `pulumi config set --secret app-platform:dbPassword '<value>'`. Only the ciphertext is committed — plaintext never touches Git.

